rooms_desc ({"You have just entered the the lavish hallway of Smurf's home.The first thing you notice is the large chandelier hanging above you.There are many beautiful pictures hanging on the walls around you.You notice the coat rack in the corner and proceed to hang your coat there","This is Smurf's living room.There is a very large television in the front of the roomthat can be well seen from the surounding couch, recliner and loveseat.As you look around the room you notice a very large picture window, andare awestruck by the beautiful view from it.","You are standing in Smurf's bedroom.You can see right away that this is her favorite room of the house.There is a King size bed in the middle of the room, neatly made withemerald green satin sheets. (her favorite color)  On the wall thereis a picture of her and a very special man in her life.  They lookvery happy together.  On the far side of the room, you notice thesteam rising from a large hottub.To the south you see a set of french doors leading out into the gardenand decide to take a look.","As you open the doors and walk out onto the patio, you are metwith the beautiful aroma of flowers.  No matter what time of year,it is always spring here.  All around you there are pots of flowersand also rows of flowers surrounding the patio.  As you walk down thecobblestone path, you are met with endless white roses.(Smurf's favorite)Along the path there are swings, and wicker benches to sit and enjoythe peace of this place.  Smurf hopes you enjoy this garden as much asshe does.","This is Smurf's private bathroom.  There is a very large tub and showeron the far wall where Smurf like to retire for a bubble bath after avery stressful day.  It is especially nice when a certain someone joins her!  There is very plush carpet on the floor and you notice several candles placed around the room.  Consider yourself lucky....not many people see this room.",0,0,0,0,0,})
